  "prefLabel": "Jus 416.01 Amendment to or Termination of Donated Conservation Easement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 416.01 Amendment to or Termination of Donated Conservation Easement. Any requests for review of an amendment to or termination of a donated conservation easement shall be submitted to the director not less than 60 days prior to the effective date of the amendment or termination.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
